{"availability":"available","full":"CasualOffice/opendoc","name":"opendoc","description":"Apache-2.0, embeddable, local-first editor for Word documents, and the deterministic Rust engine underneath. Reads and writes DOCX and ODT, exports PDF, HTML and Markdown, and runs natively, headless, or in the browser as WebAssembly. An open alternative to ONLYOFFICE Docs.","category":"Productivity","language":"Rust","stars":24,"forks":9,"created":"2026-07-23T21:17:52Z","updated":"2026-10-12T21:19:51Z","license":"Apache-2.0","branch":"main","homepage":"http://opendoc.casualoffice.org/","topics":["document-engine","docx","embeddable","layout-engine","local-first","odt","office","ooxml","pagination","pdf","rust","text-rendering","wasm","wordprocessing"],"demo":"https://opendoc.casualoffice.org/editor.html?demo=1","color":"#323057","ink":"#d6caff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-16T21:32:30.547Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-16T21:32:30.547Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-16T21:32:30.547Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-04T08:15:41.088Z","stars":15,"forks":7},{"at":"2026-10-06T15:42:53.882Z","stars":16,"forks":7},{"at":"2026-10-08T16:02:57.266Z","stars":18,"forks":7},{"at":"2026-10-11T00:22:53.981Z","stars":19,"forks":7},{"at":"2026-10-16T21:32:30.547Z","stars":24,"forks":9}],"technologies":["Rust"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["[]( [](docs/06-ROADMAP-AND-DELIVERY.md) [](rust-toolchain.toml) [](LICENSE)","A deterministic, embeddable Word-document engine written in Rust — it reads and writes .docx, holds the document in a normalized editable model, and lays it out and renders it to pixels, for native, WebAssembly, and headless hosts that need real DOCX fidelity without a browser, a server, or a UI framework.","The same engine compiles to WebAssembly and drives a live in-browser editor — open the bundled DOCX demo or visit the developer site."],"features":["Loss-aware by design. Content the semantic model doesn't yet represent is","Deterministic. The same input, fonts, and en